    "original": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "A cinematic nighttime photo of [your photo as reference] sitting alone at a wet bus\n\nstop bench, eating a burger. Rain-soaked street with orange bokeh city lights\n\nreflecting on the ground. Neon tube lights overhead. Red jacket, tan corduroy\n\npants. Moody, dark, atmospheric street photography.",
      "source": "upstream"
    },
    "translations": {
